"shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"5Jta7dTc7lteIyeMfLUJWQ","review_id":"zEKRpL2AwGvlrNCPaC5f3w","date":"2021-03-04T23:22:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.931124210357666,"text_excerpt":"Stopped in to try their oyster shooters. They were delicious!! Bartender/waitress were very nice! I also ordered a Hurricane to go. The oysters in the shooters were delicious & pleasantly plump! Hurricane on point! Next time we are in town, we will come again & try the food!"},{"business_id":"5Jta7dTc7lteIyeMfLUJWQ","review_id":"W_-ZKULRDSFNALLc_jVwWw","date":"2019-10-22T17:42:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9281177520751953,"text_excerpt":"This place is solid! Nothing fancy but the food is great. The oysters are some of the best in town. We can't seem to get any of our favorites places to be consistent with charbroiled oysters month to month other than the oyster seasons. Alligator bite are defiantly a must try. Only had them fried before and this was a nice new way to enjoy gator. Gumbo is great and the atmosphere on the corner is a nice touch. Great in and out spot."},{"business_id":"5Jta7dTc7lteIyeMfLUJWQ","review_id":"577sv8APJ6r0JgH2M8XZ1Q","date":"2019-11-04T19:26:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.920538067817688,"text_excerpt":"We stopped here for lunch on a nice fall day in New Orleans. I had the fried oysters with fries and coleslaw and an Abita Amber Beer. My wife ordered a bowl of the seafood gumbo. Both were very good. The large water glass with lots of ice was appreciated. We had a table by the window and could enjoy seeing the people strolling by on Jackson Square. Our server was efficient and food arrived promptly. This is a good place to stop for lunch."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5Jta7dTc7lteIyeMfLUJWQ","photo_id":"DY6o-VB9LBWc662Jffcpsw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DY6o-VB9LBWc662Jffcpsw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8724855184555054},{"business_id":"5Jta7dTc7lteIyeMfLUJWQ","photo_id":"s9FRcQYVfSTCo4jay30bJA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/s9FRcQYVfSTCo4jay30bJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8724855184555054}]},"notebook_case":null}
